{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145360/extras/9aa971aeef49bb70bf3f434e79d38ce5.poster.avif?t=1763706134\" width=805 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145360/extras/9aa971aeef49bb70bf3f434e79d38ce5.webm?t=1763706134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LittleRunner is a challenging physics-based platformer that tests your limits through diverse mechanical puzzles and fluid movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Movement</strong>: Sprint to gain speed, crouch to crawl, and seamlessly slide by crouching while running.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall Interaction</strong>: If your upward momentum is sufficient when hitting a wall, you can ascend along it. Grabbing a wall slows your descent\u2014but beware, falling too fast will result in a fatal plunge and level failure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ledge Grab</strong>: Automatically latch onto specific wall ledges to hang stationary. If the ledge is part of a moving platform, you'll ride along with it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Features</strong><br>Navigate through levels filled with unique mechanics designed to both assist and challenge you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce Pads</strong>: Drastically increase your jump height to reach new heights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Force Zones</strong>: Receive a burst of speed in a specific direction for quick traversal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hazardous Encounters</strong>: Experience thrilling escapes, such as narrow chases with spinning gears that will test your reflexes and nerve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145360/extras/31fb7194806ec1e8e761dd92031d46cd.poster.avif?t=1763706134\" width=804 height=522 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145360/extras/31fb7194806ec1e8e761dd92031d46cd.webm?t=1763706134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145360/extras/31fb7194806ec1e8e761dd92031d46cd.mp4?t=1763706134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4145360/ffb4bedd21c7913776faa090e39d6fc430ce44ac.jpg"},{"name":"2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4145360/db9d374eea3cc553c9eebcbcff20693f8f37bd49.jpg"},{"name":"3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4145360/8c13dd925a7c72d7501d4d226ce7c93738cfedf6.jpg"},{"name":"4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4145360/1343ce2cf6a6f23ed6d7c3d9ea9b4525a7599b40.jpg"},{"name":"5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4145360/e3dc00972b0869aaf789f136da17cd21e4ba790f.jpg"},{"name":"6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4145360/e144418ceb1f8d4b4e3ada1db1e46f8ede25af6c.jpg"},{"name":"7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4145360/ac8e949bde6708a354ebbc557ada072e296c0446.jpg"},{"name":"8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4145360/95e683a0f654a30cff1d24e1d42ab8dc32f7d3b7.jpg"},{"name":"9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4145360/d24610